# ## Infisical (recommended)
# This project uses Infisical Cloud for environment variable and secret
# management. When the Infisical CLI is available, variables are injected
# automatically via `infisical run`. No .env.local file is needed.
#
#   make infisical-login
#   infisical run --env dev -- pnpm dev
#
# If Infisical is not available, `make dev` / `make build` fall back to reading
# `import.meta.env` from `.env.local`. All Vite-exposed variables MUST use the
# `VITE_` prefix to reach `import.meta.env.VITE_*`. Keep this file in sync
# with `ImportMetaEnv` in `src/vite-env.d.ts` and the Infisical project environments.

# Base URL of the backend API the SPA talks to.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
